{"id":"n89044-1-8","stage":5,"title":"한차례 · 一次","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89044-1-8-1","ko":"오늘은 그래도 좀 시원한 것 같아.","zh":"今天好像还是有点凉快的呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시원한","meaning":"凉爽，凉快","explanation":"시원하다：凉爽，凉快；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"1","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"凉爽，凉快","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"不冷不热，适当清凉。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0e8bc1590bf4a612c020.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89044-1-8-2","ko":"응. 뜨겁던 날씨가 소나기가 한차례 쏟아지고 시원해졌어.","zh":"嗯，原本很热的天气下过一阵阵阵雨之后，变得凉快多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜨겁던","meaning":"烫，热","explanation":"뜨겁다：烫，热；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"뜨겁다","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66027","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소나기가","meaning":"雷阵雨","explanation":"소나기：雷阵雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소나기","audio":"/audio/fae7e38885116b20898a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63524","senseId":"1","lemma":"소나기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한차례","meaning":"一次，一回，一场，一轮","explanation":"한차례：一次，一回，一场，一轮","readings":[{"term":"한차례","audio":"/audio/902d5d27f0610871ef95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89044","senseId":"1","lemma":"한차례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쏟아지고","meaning":"倾泻，下大","explanation":"쏟아지다：倾泻，下大；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쏟아지다","audio":"/audio/f4ace1873bdada0ba5eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71284","senseId":"4","lemma":"쏟아지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시원해졌어.","meaning":"凉爽，凉快；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"시원하다：凉爽，凉快；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"1","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"e13d571ed55588ae","term":"뜨겁다","zh":"烫，热","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3","entryId":"66027","definition":"某物的温度高。","pronunciation":["뜨겁따"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"fae7e38885116b20","term":"소나기","zh":"雷阵雨","audio":"/audio/fae7e38885116b20898a.mp3","entryId":"63524","definition":"突然下得很大、又很快停的雨。","pronunciation":["소나기"]},{"id":"902d5d27f0610871","term":"한차례","zh":"一次，一回，一场，一轮","audio":"/audio/902d5d27f0610871ef95.mp3","entryId":"89044","definition":"表示某事发生一阵子。","pronunciation":["한차례"]},{"id":"f4ace1873bdada0b","term":"쏟아지다","zh":"倾泻，下大","audio":"/audio/f4ace1873bdada0ba5eb.mp3","entryId":"71284","definition":"雨或雪一下子下很多，或阳光暴晒。","pronunciation":["쏘다지다"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"凉爽，凉快","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"不冷不热，适当清凉。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/faef85a0e5705dfb7a18.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.373,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89044","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.1997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，原本很热的天气下过一阵阵阵雨之后，变得凉快多了。","今天好像还是有点凉快的呢。","今年夏季休假去哪里？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天好像还是有点凉快的呢。","今年夏季休假去哪里？","嗯，原本很热的天气下过一阵阵阵雨之后，变得凉快多了。"],"answer":2}]}
